briefly raised worldwide fears of a catastrophe in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:38.480
the most chilling turn yet in Moscow's invasion&nbsp;
of Ukraine. Firefighters put out the blaze. No&nbsp;&nbsp;

